# Vapi Web SDK (P2 bonus — real browser-based calls, no phone number/Twilio needed).
# Get this from your Vapi dashboard -> API keys -> Public Key. Safe to expose client-side
# (that's what a "public" key is for) — never put your Vapi PRIVATE key here.
# Leave unset to hide/disable the "Call Now" button's actual call (it'll show a clear
# error instead of failing silently).
NEXT_PUBLIC_VAPI_PUBLIC_KEY=
